# Auto-generated photo grid thumbnails (see vite-plugins/folder-thumbnails.ts)
# — regenerated on `vite dev`/`vite build`, not hand-authored, so they're not
# committed. Only the source images under src/content/folders/*/ are tracked.
src/content/folders/*/*-thumb.webp